{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 80.76,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.237
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，列出所有价格来源，标出哪些在一笔交易内可变。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，列出所有价格来源，标出哪些在一笔交易内可变。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 4.62,
   "speechEnd": 9.909
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "用储备、余额、份额价格来定价的地方，全部换掉。",
   "spoken": "用储备、余额、份额价格来定价的地方，全部换掉。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 10.36,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 10.36,
   "speechEnd": 15.231
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "审计的人，逐个检查预言机读取：正值、时效、上下限、精度。L2 上，加上排序器状态。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，逐个检查预言机读取：正值、时效、上下限、精度。L2 上，加上排序器状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 15.62,
   "dur": 8.8,
   "speechStart": 15.62,
   "speechEnd": 24.24
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "再看低流动性抵押品，有没有供应上限，和更低的抵押率。",
   "spoken": "再看低流动性抵押品，有没有供应上限，和更低的抵押率。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 24.64,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 24.64,
   "speechEnd": 29.827
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，先看协议用什么价格源。依赖单一 DEX 现货价的，风险更高。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，先看协议用什么价格源。依赖单一 DEX 现货价的，风险更高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 30.22,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 30.315,
   "speechEnd": 36.505
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "用低流动性代币做抵押，保持更高的健康度。极端行情里，先降杠杆，不要等清算。",
   "spoken": "用低流动性代币做抵押，保持更高的健康度。极端航情里，先降杠杆，不要等清算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 36.92,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 36.92,
   "speechEnd": 44.5
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头。一个大于 0、刚刚更新的价格，为什么还会错？",
   "spoken": "回到开头。一个大于 0、刚刚更新的价格，为什么还会错？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 44.9,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 44.9,
   "speechEnd": 49.85
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "因为正值和时效，只证明价格存在，而且是新的。不证明它对。",
   "spoken": "因为正值和时效，只证明价格存在，而且是新的。不证明它对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 50.6,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 50.6,
   "speechEnd": 56.889
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "要拦住它，需要合理的上下限，或者和第二个价格源比较。",
   "spoken": "要拦住它，需要合理的上下限，或者和第二个价格源比较。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 57.3,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 57.395,
   "speechEnd": 62.251
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "预言机配置的变更，要和合约代码一样测试。上线前，用真实喂价核对美元价格。",
   "spoken": "预言机配置的变更，要和合约代码一样测试。上线前，用真实喂价核对美元价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 62.64,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 62.734,
   "speechEnd": 69.5
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "价格是合约看世界的窗口。先确认，窗外是真的，再按它放贷。",
   "spoken": "价格是合约看世界的窗口。先确认，窗外是真的，再按它放贷。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 69.9,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 69.9,
   "speechEnd": 76.208
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "下一集讲 MEV 与签名安全。",
